  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "• 最終決戦でハヤテが搭乗したVF-31ジークフリードが1/72可変モデルで待望のキット化！",
      "en": "• VF-31 Siegfried, which Hayate piloted in the final battle, is now a long-awaited 1/72 variable model kit!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 大人気キャラ「フレイア・ヴィオン」が描かれたルンピカVer.デカルチャーデカールが付属する豪華版仕様で登場!!",
      "en": "• Lumpika version depicting the popular character \"Freya Wion\" comes in a deluxe version that comes with a deculture decal!!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• メッサーへの思いが込められた、ハヤテ専用のマーキングも再現！ 三形態に対応したマーキング＆デカールが付属。",
      "en": "• Hayate's exclusive marking, which expresses his feelings for Messer, is also reproduced! Markings and decals compatible with the three forms are included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 複雑な変形機構を支えるボディ構造には、一部に金属シャフトを使用。各部に内蔵したロック機構により、各形態を安定して保持することが可能。",
      "en": "• A metal shaft is used in part of the body structure that supports the complex deformation mechanism. Lock mechanisms built into each part allow each form to be held stably."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• コックピットは複座・単座の選択式。フレイアと共に搭乗する様子も再現可能！",
      "en": "• Cockpit can be selected from two-seater or single-seater. You can also recreate the appearance of boarding with Freya!"
    }
  ],
